WEBVTT

00:39:59.792 --> 00:40:02.542
I think we've always been at that moment.

00:40:03.417 --> 00:40:06.875
But this moment is different,
because of the void in leadership.

00:40:07.875 --> 00:40:11.309
There's no real moral voice
in our country,

00:40:11.333 --> 00:40:14.976
and the person who sits
in the office of the presidency

00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:19.309
is not, you know,
leading in the right way.

00:40:19.333 --> 00:40:21.893
And has kind of --

00:40:21.917 --> 00:40:25.125
no, not kind of, has given license
to certain things.

00:40:26.250 --> 00:40:28.726
And so now it's,

00:40:28.750 --> 00:40:31.375
you know, he's lit the fires.